-- 2026-08-02 - Sano commercial sales leads, batch 8 (South/East Auckland + property/facilities managers + larger SMEs)
--
-- 108 leads: 41 A / 45 B / 22 C.
-- Contact-first pass: prioritises the person who books the cleaner (office/facilities/ops manager),
-- falling back to the office@/admin@/reception@ inbox that reaches them. Contact type recorded in notes.
-- Contact mix: 81 office-inbox, 3 named-facilities, 7 named-other, 17 none.
-- Verticals: South/East professional offices (law, accounting, insurance), property & body-corporate
-- managers, facilities-management firms, manufacturing/distribution head offices, engineering, IT,
-- plus churches & community trusts. Deduped against the 330 already loaded (5 collisions dropped);
-- real published emails only, blanks NULL; healthcare excluded.
--
-- Each insert skips a row whose company already exists (case-insensitive). Run in Supabase SQL editor.

